"默认关闭。开启后，照片和动态视频均已保存即可继续清理检查；取回后可能需要重新配对，部分动态效果可能无法恢复。其他已开启的检查仍会执行。" = "Off by default. Once the photo and video are saved, cleanup checking can continue. Pairing may need repair after retrieval, and some motion effects may not restore. Other enabled checks still apply.";
